  "description": "Sung Nam-Gung can’t hold down a job, and he’s lost yet another one after injuring artist Min-Tae Kyeon during a routine package delivery. But Sung’s in luck—Min-Tae’s been looking for a new model, and Sung has the perfect combo of gloomy personality and chiseled body. As Sung spends night after night under the hands of Min-Tae, both their families begin to suspect the other’s motives. Will the artist and his muse be able to escape the destinies their families have laid out for them?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
